     "answer": "Four reasons are on Methodology. AtPEP1 is known mainly for biotic stress, while the project needed a peptide answering measurable abiotic stress, which is what the sensors detect. Drought was shown by our own analysis to be prominent in Taiwan and is directly signalled by BoPep4. An abiotic readout also lets us score direct plant phenotypes such as root length and biomass instead of staging an interaction with another organism. And BoPep4's variable N-terminus with an intact conserved C-terminal PEP motif gives a place to mutate without touching the activity core.",
     "answer_zh": "方法論頁列出四個理由。AtPEP1 主要以生物性逆境著稱，而本專案需要能回應「可量測的非生物逆境」的肽，因為那才是感測器偵測的對象。我們自己的分析顯示乾旱在台灣相當突出，而 BoPep4 直接傳遞乾旱訊號。非生物性的讀出也讓我們能直接量植物表現型，例如根長與生物量，而不必安排與另一個生物的交互作用。此外 BoPep4 的 N 端變異度高、C 端保守 PEP 模組 (PEP motif) 完整，提供了不動活性核心也能突變的位置。",
