     "q": "Your own records describe the first screen of cycle 1 in three different ways. What are they, and what is missing from cycle 2?",
     "q_zh": "你們自己的記錄用三種不同方式描述第 1 循環的第一次篩選。那三種說法是什麼？第 2 循環又缺了什麼？",
     "answer": "Three statements sit in the same file, Engineering_.docx of 21 September 2026: the DBTL 1 test field says transformant colonies were screened by colony PCR and gave inconsistent, low-efficiency cloning; the DBTL 2 design field says transformation did not reveal any colonies; and the light-sensing module says barely any colonies transformed. They cannot all be true of the same plates, and which one is depends on notebook pages we do not have. Cycle 2 is worse: the document goes straight from the build into cycle 3, so no gel and no conclusion exist for that attempt, and its design field opens on a lesson about insufficient expression from Pveg-RBS0 that cycle 1 never taught, at a point in the timeline where no expression measurement of any kind exists in our records.",
     "answer_zh": "三種說法都在同一份檔案 Engineering_.docx（2026 年 9 月 21 日）裡：DBTL 1 的 test 欄說轉型菌落做了菌落 PCR，結果是不一致且效率低的選殖；DBTL 2 的 design 欄說轉型沒有長出任何菌落；光感應模組那段說幾乎沒有菌落轉型成功。它們不可能同時為真，而哪一個才對取決於我們手上沒有的實驗記錄頁。第 2 循環更糟：文件從 build 直接跳到第 3 循環，所以那次嘗試沒有膠也沒有結論，而它的 design 欄一開頭就引用一個第 1 循環從未教過的教訓，說 Pveg-RBS0 表達不足，而在時間軸上的那個時點，我們的記錄裡根本沒有任何表達量測。",
