     "trap": "Calling these transformation efficiencies; they are single plates per condition with no input count taken, so they are colony counts.",
     "trap_zh": "把這些稱為轉型效率；每個條件只有單一培養皿、也沒有記錄投入量，所以它們只是菌落數。"
