     "answer": "It is an E. coli expression blocking device, kit entry STK207: a B0015 terminator between two recombination sites with the ribosome binding site behind it, which keeps the cargo silent while the plasmid is being built in E. coli and recombines out in B. subtilis. It matters more in the constitutive module than in the light-gated one, because a constitutive promoter would otherwise express the cargo throughout the E. coli cloning. It is ordered and amplified as one part, so it reads as a single box on our construct maps even though the sequenced map resolves it into its pieces. Two things are unresolved: our files disagree on whether assembly I carries EEBD-MF001 or EEBD-RBS0, which is open fix P5 and is settled by opening the I3 or I6 read, and the RiboJ and EEBD parts have no citation anywhere in our records.",
     "answer_zh": "它是大腸桿菌表達阻斷裝置 (E. coli expression blocking device)，套件條目 STK207：兩個重組位點之間夾一個 B0015 終止子，後面接核醣體結合位，讓貨物基因在質體於大腸桿菌中建構期間保持靜默，並在枯草桿菌中重組移除。它在組成型模組中比在受光模組中更重要，因為組成型啟動子否則會在整個大腸桿菌選殖期間表達貨物基因。它是以單一部件訂購與擴增，所以在我們的構築圖上讀起來是一個方塊，儘管定序後的圖會把它解析成各個元件。有兩件事未解：我們的檔案對組裝 I 帶的是 EEBD-MF001 還是 EEBD-RBS0 看法不同，那是未解項 P5，只要打開 I3 或 I6 的定序結果就能解決；另外 RiboJ 與 EEBD 兩個部件在我們的記錄中完全沒有引用來源。",
