     "answer": "The page is explicit: the fitted module is rated 0.2 µm microfiltration, it has no 50 kDa molecular-weight cut-off, and it does not retain secreted vesicles. The pore is large enough to pass ACC deaminase, which is its purpose, so it also passes small vesicles, cell debris and medium components. Containment therefore rests on cell size alone, with B. subtilis given as 0.25 to 1.0 µm in diameter on the containment section. Anything below the pore size reaches the field along with the protectant.",
     "answer_zh": "該頁寫得很明確：裝上的模組額定為 0.2 µm 微過濾，沒有 50 kDa 分子量截留 (MWCO)，也不會留住分泌型囊泡。孔徑大到足以讓 ACC 去胺酶通過（這正是目的），因此也會讓小囊泡、細胞碎片與培養基成分通過。所以圍阻只靠細胞尺寸：圍阻章節把 B. subtilis 的直徑寫為 0.25 至 1.0 µm。任何小於孔徑的東西都會隨保護劑一起進入田間。",
