     "answer": "No, and we have to say so. Both reactor growth runs ran at 94 mL/min, which is the number behind the growth result. The pump's vendor sheet gives a range of 230 to 2,600 mL/min, and the reactor hydraulics build their shear, Reynolds, pressure-drop and critical-flux numbers on 230 mL/min as a floor, which sits above every measured point below dial 16. The bench calibration puts dial 10 at 100.3 mL/min while the two pressure runs put the same dial at 140 and at 121.7 to 116.7 mL/min, about 40 per cent apart, and the pump document names a setting 19 that has no row in its own table. The fix recorded on Results is to decide which flow the hydraulics are computed at, recompute, and state on every page which flow each result came from.",
     "answer_zh": "不一致，而且必須講清楚。兩次反應器生長運轉都在 94 mL/min，生長結果就是這個流速下得到的。泵的廠商規格為 230 至 2,600 mL/min，而反應器水力計算（剪切、雷諾數、壓降、臨界通量）都以 230 mL/min 當下限，但這個值高於刻度 16 以下所有實測點。檯面校正顯示刻度 10 為 100.3 mL/min，兩次壓力運轉同一刻度卻讀到 140 與 121.7–116.7 mL/min，相差約四成；泵文件還提到「設定 19 為 288 mL/min」，但表中沒有設定 19 這一列。Results 頁記下的修正方式是：決定水力計算採用哪個流速、重算，並在每一頁標明每個結果是在什麼流速下取得。",
