     "q": "Describe the photometer's light path component by component, and write down how a lux pair becomes an OD600 number.",
     "q_zh": "請逐一說明光度計的光路元件，並寫出一組照度讀數如何變成 OD600 數值。",
     "answer": "Light leaves a 600 nm amber LED, passes a paralleling lens, then a 2 mm slit, into a 90/10 beamsplitter. Ten per cent goes straight to a reference sensor before the sample; ninety per cent passes the flow cuvette to the sample sensor. Both are GY-302 lux sensors on one I2C bus on an Arduino UNO Q. Bench spacings, fixed since cycle 1, are 5.5 cm LED tip to lens, 10 cm lens to beamsplitter centre, 2 cm beamsplitter to each sensor. The blank gives K = sample/reference, and every live reading is OD600 = −log(sample / (K × reference)), with the LED switched off each cycle for dark readings that are subtracted first. Acquisition is every 10 minutes and the dashboard is served on port 7000.",
     "answer_zh": "光由 600 nm 琥珀色 LED 出發，經平行化透鏡、2 mm 狹縫，進入 90/10 分光鏡。10% 在樣品之前直接射向參考感測器，90% 穿過流通比色槽到樣品感測器。兩顆都是 GY-302 照度感測器，接在 Arduino UNO Q 的同一條 I2C 匯流排上。cycle 1 定下並沿用的間距為：LED 尖端到透鏡 5.5 cm、透鏡到分光鏡中心 10 cm、分光鏡到各感測器 2 cm。空白值給出 K = 樣品/參考，之後每筆讀數為 OD600 = −log(樣品 / (K × 參考))；每個量測週期會先關閉 LED 取暗讀數並扣除。取樣間隔 10 分鐘，儀表板服務於 7000 埠。",
