     "answer": "Two runs against a Bio-Drop, scored against cumulative TiO₂ mass as the ground truth. Both instruments regress against mass at R² above 0.999, Releaf 0.9999 and Bio-Drop 0.9998. Plotted directly against the Bio-Drop with the line of identity, the raw uncalibrated Releaf points agree to a median paired difference of 3.8 per cent, with a residual scatter of RMSE 0.011 OD600 at R² 0.9997 about the fitted line. In Test 1 the residual scatter against the mass standard was 0.024 OD600 for Releaf against 0.030 for the Bio-Drop. Two single points were excluded on objective grounds, both Bio-Drop readings, and both are shown as open markers rather than deleted.",
     "answer_zh": "兩次運轉以 Bio-Drop 為對照，並以累加的 TiO₂ 質量作為真值評分。兩台儀器對質量的回歸 R² 都高於 0.999（Releaf 0.9999、Bio-Drop 0.9998）。直接對 Bio-Drop 畫圖並加上等值線時，未校正的 Releaf 原始讀數的配對中位差為 3.8%，對擬合線的殘差 RMSE 為 0.011 OD600、R² 0.9997。在 Test 1 中，對質量標準的殘差為 Releaf 0.024 OD600、Bio-Drop 0.030。有兩個單點依客觀理由被排除，兩者都是 Bio-Drop 的讀數，且以空心標記呈現而非刪除。",
