     "id": "HW-16",
     "type": "weakness",
     "q": "Your dashboard reports a bubble-and-outlier rejection rate. In the long run it read 42.9 per cent, then 14.3, then 0. Explain that, and tell me where the rule is written down.",
     "q_zh": "你們的儀表板會報告氣泡與離群值剔除率。在長時間運轉中它先是 42.9%，然後 14.3%，再到 0%。請解釋，並說明這條規則寫在哪裡。",
     "answer": "We cannot fully explain it, and the wiki says so. The filter takes 14 lux readings in a burst, uses the median as a bubble-proof centre, computes the median absolute deviation of the 13 distances, and rejects anything beyond median ± 3·MAD. The learn note on cycle 5 records that the three rates cannot all be cumulative, that the rejection rule is not written down anywhere, and that it needs stating as a rule including the window the rate is computed over before any filtered data appears on the wiki. The photometer page adds a second problem from the other end: on a burst of only fourteen the MAD is itself noisy, so a clean burst loses about one reading in fourteen at ±3·MAD and half of all clean bursts lose at least one.",
     "answer_zh": "我們無法完全解釋，而維基也如此寫明。濾波器以叢發方式取 14 筆照度讀數，用中位數作為不受氣泡影響的中心，計算 13 個距離的中位絕對偏差 (MAD)，剔除超出中位數 ± 3·MAD 的點。Cycle 5 的學習欄記下：三個比率不可能都是累積值、剔除規則沒有寫在任何地方，且必須先寫成一條規則（包含比率是在多長的視窗內計算）才能讓任何經過濾的資料出現在維基上。光度計頁從另一端補上第二個問題：只有十四筆的叢發中，MAD 本身就很嘈雜，所以在 ±3·MAD 下乾淨的叢發平均每十四筆會掉一筆，而且一半的乾淨叢發至少掉一筆。",
