     "id": "HW-18",
     "type": "decision",
     "q": "You measured every LED individually and sorted them into tiers. Then you stopped using LED selection to set intensity. Why?",
     "q_zh": "你們逐顆量測每個 LED 並分成不同強度階，然後卻不再用 LED 篩選來設定強度。為什麼？",
     "answer": "Because the measurement showed selection could not produce distinct levels. Across parts sold as identical the green LEDs ran 2.01 to 2.54 kLux, a 26 per cent spread, and the red 360 to 438 lux, 22 per cent. Sorting tightened each group of four well inside 1 per cent for green low and mid and about 2 per cent for red, so matching makes a column agree with itself, which the comparison needs. But the separation between tiers came out at only about 7 per cent green low to high and about 10 per cent red, which is the natural spread of sorted parts rather than three light levels. So the tiers had to come from PWM duty cycle in software, with matching kept for within-column agreement. We should also admit the green high group spans 2.38 to 2.50, roughly 5 per cent, because it is the leftover group of what did not match anything else.",
     "answer_zh": "因為量測顯示篩選無法產生真正分開的強度層級。在以相同規格販售的零件中，綠光 LED 從 2.01 到 2.54 kLux，差距 26%；紅光從 360 到 438 lux，差距 22%。排序後每組四顆收得很緊：綠低與綠中都在 1% 以內，紅色各組約 2%，因此配對能讓同一欄彼此一致，這是比較所需要的。但階與階之間的差距只有綠光低到高約 7%、紅光約 10%，這是排序後零件的自然散佈，而不是三個光強度層級。因此強度階必須改由軟體的 PWM 占空比產生，配對則保留用於欄內一致性。我們也應承認綠高組跨 2.38 到 2.50（約 5%），因為它是配不上其他組的剩餘組。",
