     "answer": "We do not have one. Section 8, the Level 2 intensity variability test the instrument was built for, is a set of planned headings with no text, and so is section 7, the proof of concept with its demonstrated culture run, flow conditions, temperature and starting and final OD. Results states the same thing from the whole-project side: no experiment anywhere shows PcpcG2 output changing with green light, and the fix is one dose series on DiOPAL with an expression readout, green against dark. Results also says the array's tiers cannot yet be called intensity tiers and that evenness of dose across the 24 positions was never measured. The one light-arm dataset we do have, R5 on the Digital Twin, measured growth rate rather than expression and found green induction costs no growth.",
     "answer_zh": "我們沒有答案。第 8 節——儀器當初就是為它而造的 Level 2 強度變異測試——只是一組預定的標題，沒有內文；第 7 節概念驗證（示範培養運轉、流動條件、溫度、起始與最終 OD）同樣如此。Results 頁從全專案角度說了同一件事：沒有任何實驗顯示 PcpcG2 的輸出隨綠光改變，補救方式是在 DiOPAL 上做一組劑量序列並加上表達讀值，綠光對暗處。Results 也指出陣列的階目前還不能稱為強度階，且 24 個位置之間劑量的均勻性從未量測。我們唯一有的光照分組資料是 Digital Twin 的 R5，它量的是生長速率而非表達量，結論是綠光誘導不犧牲生長。",
