     "answer": "The plate envelope is 117.50 × 92.50 × 25.08 mm with a 3.175 mm top slab, carrying 13 bores of ∅11.26 mm on a 21.59 mm pitch, staggered 4, 5, 4 with the outer rows half a pitch off the middle. Flotation is two sealed air chambers, one per long side, each an internal void of 113.80 × 6.90 × 20.32 mm capped underneath by a 1.7 mm skin, 28.7 cm³ for the pair, with nothing at all beneath the middle of the plate. The pontoons are hollow with a teardrop cross-section at 15 per cent gyroid infill in PLA. The geometry was measured off the same STLs the part is printed from, on a 0.1 mm grid.",
     "answer_zh": "板體外形為 117.50 × 92.50 × 25.08 mm，上板厚 3.175 mm，含 13 個 ∅11.26 mm 的孔，間距 21.59 mm，以 4、5、4 交錯排列，外側兩排相對中排偏移半個間距。浮力來自兩個密封氣室，各在一側長邊，內部空腔為 113.80 × 6.90 × 20.32 mm，下方以 1.7 mm 薄殼封住，兩者合計 28.7 cm³，板中央下方完全沒有結構。浮筒為中空、水滴形斷面，PLA 材質、15% 迴旋 (gyroid) 填充。幾何是以列印該件的同一組 STL 在 0.1 mm 網格上量測的。",
