     "q": "Is the hydroponic plate part of the delivery system, and what conditions is it specified for?",
     "q_zh": "水耕浮板是遞送系統的一部分嗎？它的規格適用於什麼條件？",
     "answer": "It is the downstream growth plate the protectant is tested on, not a field delivery device. It is specified for 13 Arabidopsis seedlings in liquid medium: seed holders made from 1.5 mL black microcentrifuge tube lids with a 2 mm hole and 0.7 per cent agar, four days of stratification in the dark at 4 °C, then an opaque box holding 250 mL of half-strength MS at pH 5.7 to 5.8, in an incubator at 22 °C and 40 to 45 per cent humidity, with the medium changed every one to two weeks. The buoyancy sizing is a displacement calculation redone every time the design changed; the one worked case given is a plate mass of roughly 180 g where the pontoons needed about 0.65 cubic inches of extra volume each. The plate's full design, build, test and learn cycles are written up with the plant experiments, not on the hardware page.",
     "answer_zh": "它是保護劑受測的下游生長平台，不是田間遞送裝置。它的規格是液體培養基中的 13 株阿拉伯芥：種子座以 1.5 mL 黑色微量離心管蓋打一個 2 mm 孔、填 0.7% 洋菜膠製成，先在 4 °C 黑暗中層積四天，之後放入裝有 250 mL 半濃度 MS（pH 5.7 至 5.8）的不透光盒，置於 22 °C、濕度 40 至 45% 的培養箱中，每一至兩週更換培養基。浮力尺寸計算是排水量問題，設計每改一次就重算；頁面給的一個實例是板重約 180 g 時，每根浮筒還差約 0.65 立方英吋的體積。浮板完整的設計、建造、測試、學習循環寫在植物實驗那邊，不在硬體頁。",
