     "id": "HW-26",
     "type": "fact",
     "q": "What does the digital twin actually measure on the reactor today, and what stops a bug in the software from driving the loop past a limit?",
     "q_zh": "數位孿生今天在反應器上實際量到什麼？又是什麼機制阻止軟體錯誤把迴路推過安全上限？",
     "answer": "Seven measured channels and six motor-driven valves on one Arduino Uno Q. In-line: OD600 from the dual-beam photometer, pH on a newly integrated probe, four pressure transducers one on each side of the module, and loop flow on a turbine meter. Commanded: two pinch valves and four Luer valves. Soft: lumen ΔP, transmembrane pressure and fouling ratio computed through the hydraulic model. Planned, drawn dashed: green light, temperature, dissolved oxygen and permeate mass. The interlocks run on the microcontroller rather than in the browser, so no fault in a model or page can drive the loop past a limit: transmembrane pressure above 0.50 bar opens the pinch valve, and five seconds with no command from the interface opens it and turns the light off. The link is Web Serial over USB at 115,200 baud with a two-second heartbeat.",
     "answer_zh": "在一片 Arduino Uno Q 上有七個量測通道與六個馬達驅動閥。在線 (in-line)：雙光束光度計的 OD600、新整合的 pH 探頭、模組兩側各一共四個壓力傳感器，以及渦輪流量計的迴路流量。受命令 (commanded)：兩個夾管閥與四個 luer 閥。軟感測 (soft)：由水力模型算出的管內壓差、跨膜壓與積垢比。規劃中（以虛線繪製）：綠光、溫度、溶氧與透過液質量。安全連鎖執行在微控制器而非瀏覽器，因此模型或網頁的任何錯誤都無法把迴路推過上限：跨膜壓高於 0.50 bar 時夾管閥打開，介面五秒未下命令則同樣打開並關掉光源。連線為 USB 上的 Web Serial，115,200 baud，心跳間隔兩秒。",
