     "q_zh": "你們的專案一句話是「感測逆境、發出光、釋放保護劑」。逆境預測模型是用什麼訓練的？又用什麼驗證過？",
     "answer": "The index in production has not been fitted to anything. Its four weights were chosen by the team and never fitted, and the three onset thresholds and six Hill constants behind equations 2 to 4 are not written down anywhere; they live in a script, and they produced the 990-scenario sweep, the heat map and every stress score the interface has shown. The yield-fitted replacement, trained against Agriculture and Food Agency county rice yields since 2001 with a held-out season, has an introduction, a chain diagram and a definition, and no fitted coefficient, no R² and no validation season, because none has been written down yet. The only dose response of our own behind any arm is the salinity one, nine Arabidopsis seedlings per group at four NaCl levels on agar on one day, and nothing converts molarity in agar to field conductivity. EC itself is estimated from coastal distance and elevation where no sensor exists and is called the weakest input in the model; VPD is not independently measured. There is no field validation anywhere on the page.",
     "answer_zh": "目前上線的指數沒有對任何資料擬合過。它的四個權重由團隊自選、從未擬合，而式 (2) 至 (4) 背後的三個起始閾值與六個 Hill 常數沒有寫在任何地方；它們存在於一個腳本裡，卻產生了 990 組情境掃描、熱圖以及介面顯示過的每一個逆境分數。用產量擬合的替代版本（以農糧署 2001 年起的各縣市稻作產量訓練，並保留一季作測試）目前有引言、鏈條圖與定義，但沒有任何擬合係數、沒有 R²、沒有驗證季，因為都還沒寫下來。唯一有我們自己劑量反應支持的只有鹽分那一支：洋菜膠上四個 NaCl 濃度、每組九株阿拉伯芥、單日單次實驗，而且沒有任何換算把洋菜膠中的莫耳濃度轉成田間導電度。EC 本身在沒有感測器時是由海岸距離與海拔推估，被頁面稱為模型中最弱的輸入；VPD 則沒有獨立量測。頁面上沒有任何田間驗證。",
