     "q_zh": "你們的人文實踐頁說五月到八月辦了三場農友外展活動，卻列出四場，其中一場在九月。評審能把這一頁當作多可靠的紀錄？",
     "answer": "The substance is solid and the bookkeeping is not, and we should fix the bookkeeping rather than defend it. The Farmer interviews section says three outreach events from May to August and then carries four: Farmer Expo 16 May, Tamsui Happy Farm 21 July, Water Garden, and the Lanyang River cooperative, which has no date at all. The Water Garden event is dated 6 September in that section and 5 September everywhere else on the page. The page also says five core experts and shows four continuous-engagement cards. And the Project Evolution Map states in its own caption that black text is the team's own record while orange text is a drafted summary, so part of the map is not yet verified team writing. None of this changes which conversation produced which design change, each of which is dated in the pipelines, but a judge checking two numbers in a row will find both wrong.",
     "answer_zh": "內容本身是紮實的，帳目不是；我們應該修正帳目而不是為它辯護。「農友訪談」一節說五月到八月有三場外展活動，接著卻列了四場：5 月 16 日花博農民市集、7 月 21 日淡水幸福農場、水花園，以及完全沒有日期的蘭陽溪合作社。水花園那場在該節寫 9 月 6 日，但頁面其他所有地方都是 9 月 5 日。該頁也說「五位核心專家」，卻只呈現四張持續交流卡片。此外，專案演進地圖在自己的圖說中聲明：黑色文字是團隊自己的紀錄，橘色文字是草擬的摘要，因此地圖有一部分還不是經過核實的團隊撰述。這些都不改變「哪一次對談造成哪一項設計改變」——那些在 pipeline 裡都有日期——但評審若連查兩個數字，會發現兩個都錯。",
