     "id": "BE-22",
     "type": "weakness",
     "q": "Which country do you enter after Taiwan? I count several different answers on your wiki.",
     "q_zh": "台灣之後你們進入哪個國家？我在你們的維基上看到好幾個不同答案。",
     "answer": "You are right, and we should fix it to one sequence. The stakeholder entry says we decided to expand to the Philippines and Indonesia after Taiwan; the distribution section lists the USA, EU, Philippines and Vietnam as looser markets, in a sentence that then contrasts them with Europe and Japan, which is self-contradictory since the EU is in the list; the development plan runs Taiwan, Philippines in year 3, Vietnam second; the conclusion runs Taiwan and Philippines, then Vietnam and the US, then Brazil and Ghana; and Laws and Regulations prioritizes the EU as the first international commercialization market. The development plan and the Laws page are the two we trust; the others are stale drafts.",
     "answer_zh": "您說得對，我們應該統一成一條路線。利害關係人條目說台灣之後決定拓展到菲律賓與印尼；通路章節把美國、歐盟、菲律賓、越南列為法規較寬鬆的市場，卻在同一句把它們和「歐洲或日本」對比，而歐盟就在清單裡，自相矛盾；產品發展計畫是台灣、第 3 年菲律賓、越南次之；結論是台灣與菲律賓、再越南與美國、再巴西與迦納；Laws and Regulations 則以歐盟為首個國際商業化市場。我們信任的是產品發展計畫與法規頁，其餘是過期草稿。",
