     "q_zh": "你們已發布的商業計畫還缺什麼？要經營這家公司，你們必須聘用誰？",
     "answer": "The page declares four gaps and we should name them rather than talk around them. The PESTEL analysis is not written yet; the World Vegetable Centre entry has no What we changed line; the roles the company would have to recruit are not named on the page, only the expertise in the Key resources panel; and the full business plan sections the page quotes, 1.1, 7.1 and 7.2, are not published on the wiki, so a judge cannot check the numbers we cite from them. We also have smaller errors to clear: the membrane is 0.2 micrometre, not 0.22, and it has no molecular-weight cutoff, so the risk table's miscalibrated cutoff row does not describe our hardware.",
     "answer_zh": "該頁自己宣告了四個缺口，我們應該直接點名而不是繞過去。PESTEL 分析尚未撰寫；世界蔬菜中心（World Vegetable Centre）條目沒有「我們改了什麼」那一行；公司需要招募的職位並未列於該頁，只有關鍵資源欄中的專業領域；而該頁引用的完整商業計畫第 1.1、7.1、7.2 節並未發布在維基上，所以評審無法核對我們引自其中的數字。還有幾個較小的錯誤要清理：膜孔徑是 0.2 微米而非 0.22，而且它沒有分子量截留值（MWCO），所以風險表中「截留值校準錯誤」那一列並不符合我們的硬體。",
