     "answer": "It is computation and it never touched a bench. The stress index, the forward projection, the measurement trust layer and the land, farm-size and farmer-age layers were all written and run on real data, and they are reported on Math Model, Digital Twin and Geospatial Analysis with their error bars. But no forecast has ever driven a light, and no light driven by a forecast has reached a culture. All four Detect criteria are Awaiting data: no sensor accuracy test, no repeatability CV, no time-series response, no severity series. The command path cannot be closed end to end until the induction curve in the Produce stage exists.",
