     "q": "What did your long photometer run establish, and how long was it?",
     "q_zh": "你們那次長時間的光度計運轉確立了什麼？它跑了多久？",
     "answer": "It started on 21 July 2026 at 22 °C, logged at ten-minute intervals, and produced 2,671 valid rows. A process event sits between 120 and 160 hours, an instrument event begins around 215 hours, the sensor alarm fires at 216.3 hours, and from 243.0 hours the OD channel cannot be used at all. Separately, against a BioDrop reading the same titanium dioxide suspension the instrument is linear: ours equals 1.018 times BioDrop minus 0.031, R squared 0.995, and it is the steadier of the two above 30 mg of added TiO2. Two honest problems: three of our pages give three different lengths for the run, 400, 434 and 336 hours, and nobody recorded the medium, the inoculum or which compartment the optics sat on, so the trace shows an instrument running rather than a culture growing.",
     "answer_zh": "它在 2026 年 7 月 21 日於 22 °C 開始，每十分鐘記錄一次，產生 2,671 筆有效資料列。製程事件落在 120 到 160 小時之間，儀器事件約在 215 小時開始，感測器警報在 216.3 小時觸發，從 243.0 小時起 OD 通道完全不能用。另外，在讀同一份二氧化鈦懸浮液時與 BioDrop 相比，我們的儀器是線性的：我們等於 1.018 乘 BioDrop 減 0.031，R 平方 0.995，而且在加入超過 30 mg TiO2 之後我們比它更穩。兩個要誠實說的問題：我們有三頁給了三個不同的運轉長度——400、434、336 小時；而且沒有人記錄培養基、接種物，或光學元件裝在哪一個腔室，所以那條曲線顯示的是一台儀器在運轉，不是一群細胞在生長。",
